{"Title":"An Act relative to local public housing authorities","BillNumber":"S850","DocketNumber":"SD177","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-09T13:56:11.8"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-09T13:56:11.8"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S850/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Brady, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 850) of Michael D. Brady for legislation relative to the use of community preservation funding by local public housing authorities.  Housing.","DocumentText":"\tSection 5 of Chapter 44B of the General Laws is hereby amended in clause (b) (2) by adding after the words “not be used for maintenance” the following words “provided however local public housing authorities established pursuant to Chapter 121B may use such funds only for extraordinary maintenance, equipment replacement betterments and additions”.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J28","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J28"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}